{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44687","headline":"出赐玄奘衲袈裟衣应制 · 道恭","name":"出赐玄奘衲袈裟衣应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"福田资象德，圣种理幽薰。\n不持金作缕，还用彩成文。\n朱青自掩映，翠绮相氤氲。\n独有离离叶，恒向稻畦分。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道恭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44687.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44687","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}